{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>談起東京高級燒肉，相信大家對人氣燒肉集團USHIGORO都不陌生。這次來到他們旗下、由連續8年榮獲米芝蓮一星的「肉割烹 上」延伸出的新店「喜円」。新店由曾在「上」修業超過7年的丸子隼人主廚掌舵，店內設有少量吧枱座位，空間小巧且氛圍高級。\n</p>\n<p>肉割烹Omakase的主角是日本稀有黑毛和牛「三田勢戶牛」，油花細緻且脂肪熔點低，肉質軟嫩之餘鮮味突出。整個套餐令人印象最深的是夏多布里昂牛柳三文治，外脆內嫩；炭火燒和牛牛扒粉嫩多汁，中間還有和牛涮涮鍋，食法相當豐富。</p>\n<p>晚市廚師發辦每位22,000日圓（折合約港幣$1,100，另收服務費）。以這個和牛品質、份量與服務水準而言，性價比相當合理，特別適合喜愛和牛、想一次嘗試不同吃法的朋友。</p>\n<p>肉割烹 喜円（KIEN）<br/>\n📍地址：東京都港区西麻布2-24-14 Barbizon73 B1F<br/>\n🚇交通：六本木站步行約10分鐘\n</p>\n<p>🩵留言「肉」即Send預約link俾你～</p>\n<p>為食出走 ｜ 用味蕾探索世界，由地道小食到追求極致的星級餐廳，每一啖都品嚐著每個城市最獨特的風味。哪一道美食令你念念不忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的為食出走經歷！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179360646275034936_20744657726ae8433fb2ec7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179360646275034936_20744657726ae8433fb2ec7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@puddingfoodhk)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfOm-B6zlBf/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e4%ba%acomakase/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東京omakase</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e4%ba%ac%e7%87%92%e8%82%89_1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東京燒肉</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e4%ba%ac%e7%be%8e%e9%a3%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東京美食</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@puddingfoodhk資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfOm-B6zlBf/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 2 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:21:03.424644+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":642,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T08:01:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T09:20:09.373441+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T08:18:21.107817+00:00","content_hash":"bf2c01c859bb43a3bf9264f0c941af9a28b13b872a8ca1ddb62dd3ee33560f7d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}